\begin{lemma}\label{lem:one-up-new}
Given a one-level minimum cut data structure $(G, \calP, CC, F, \Lambda_{G_*})$ with parameters $c, \phi, c',  \gamma, \alpha$ satisfying the following inequalities 
\[c' = c^2 + 2c,\gamma > c',  \alpha \geq (c^2 + 2c)\cdot 2^{O(\log^{1/3}n\log\log n)} / \phi, \text{ and } \phi \leq \frac{1 }{2^{\log^{3/4} n}},\]
